{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25135","headline":"赠琴棋僧歌 · 张瀛","name":"赠琴棋僧歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我尝听师法一说，波上莲花水中月。\n不垢不净是色空，无法无空亦无灭。\n我尝听师禅一观，浪溢鳌头蟾魄满。\n河沙世界尽空空，一寸寒灰冷灯畔。\n我又听师琴一抚，长松唤住秋山雨。\n弦中雅弄若铿金，指下寒泉流太古。\n我又听师棋一着，山顶坐沈红日脚。\n阿谁称是国手人，罗浮道士赌却鹤。\n输却药，法怀斟下红霞丹，束手不敢争头角。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张瀛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}